klatt_tts: formant speech synthesis and English text-to-phoneme front end.

Source: Moonshine, https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine
Revision: 234f60faa0eb388b01cdf7e60aca232af37aefda
Paths: micro/klatt-tts (klatt-tts/) and micro/g2p (g2p/), MIT licensed (LICENSE).

Changes from that revision:
- g2p/src/g2p_dict.cc selects g2p_compact_data.h when LAKESHARK_COMPACT_DICT
  is defined, in place of the full g2p_dict_data.h, which is not included here.
- klatt-tts/include/tts/synth_stream.h adds a read-only arena_used_bytes().
- g2p/src/g2p_numbers.cc reads numbers longer than 15 digits digit by digit,
  where upstream would overflow its accumulator.
- g2p/src/g2p_compact_data.h is generated by make_compact.py from the
  upstream g2p_dict_data.h at the revision above. That table is derived from
  the CMU Pronouncing Dictionary; its notice is in LICENSE.CMUdict and must
  accompany source and binary distributions.
- Upstream tests, README and build files are not included.
